WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:05.160
This video shows how to update several fee records at once on your phone.

00:00:06.821 --> 00:00:15.893
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Collect Payments. Scroll down past the filters to the fee cards.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:28.799
On a phone there is no box to select everyone, so tap the small box on each student's card. Tick all three students. The bar at the bottom counts them: 3 selected.

00:00:49.117 --> 00:00:54.517
In the bar at the bottom, choose the account that receives the money, here Main Cash.

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:09.980
Tap Pay Full. A message says the records were marked as fully paid, and every selected card now shows Paid. The same bar also has a Delete button for the selected records.

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:22.814
All the selected fees are paid in one step.
